          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:05:26 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Committed to making healthcare better, together</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:27:30 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "sectionseparator": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:25:54 GMT+0000",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:25:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/sectionseparator"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:05:26 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Our employees are driven by a strong purpose to serve and give back, with a commitment to people and the planet. So, when we get the chance to support an organization whose work aligns with our mission and also offers our teams the chance to help make healthcare better around the world, we take it!<br>\n</p>\n<p>Our partnership with Operation Smile advances our mission through medical education initiatives as well as medical missions that directly serve those in need. These education and training programs are designed to train healthcare professionals and build surgical capacity in under-resourced countries such as Rwanda.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 22 2019 20:26:28 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
