          "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 22 2019 19:56:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Surgical training rotations on this mission are designed to train residents to perform a variety of surgery cases. Despite poor lighting in the operating room, our PhotonBlade provided surgeons with better visibility thanks to the adjustable illumination it provides.<br>\n</p>\n",
