        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 22 2019 19:58:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>The spring 2019 Rwanda Surgical Training Rotation succeeded in advancing the skills of another group of residents to perform complex surgery procedures to better serve the needs of their communities. Our team was proud to support the mission to improve access to healthcare in the region, and grateful for the opportunity to share the experience with the dedicated team of surgeons, residents from University of Rwanda and Operation Smile.<br>\n</p>\n<p>More about the program:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>11 surgical and anesthesia instructors</li>\n<li>14 residents</li>\n<li>13 days</li>\n<li>86 patients who recieved surgery</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2019 19:31:36 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
